      <title>R星北方工作室负责人尼尔森：GTA 6驾驶融合GTA 4重量与GTA 5流畅</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/R%E6%98%9F%E5%8C%97%E6%96%B9%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%A4%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%BA%E5%B0%BC%E5%B0%94%E6%A3%AEGTA-6%E9%A9%BE%E9%A9%B6%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88GTA-4%E9%87%8D%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8EGTA-5%E6%B5%81%E7%95%85/</link>
